For every command, show:

- Exact command.
- Whether it executed.
- Pass or fail.
- Test counts where available.
- Relevant report or log location.

Do not summarize an unexecuted test as passed.

## I. Remaining risks

Identify everything not implemented, tested, or verified.

Explicitly identify infrastructure or external configuration still required.

## J. Release assessment

Give separate conclusions for:

- Local development readiness.
- Internal testing readiness.
- Multi-device cloud synchronization readiness.
- Backup and restore reliability.
- Production data-integrity readiness.
- Signed production release readiness.

Do not award a high readiness score because the application compiles or CI passes.

